msgid ""
"Which grace period decides when this customer's overdue invoices count as unpaid (and stop new sales orders):\n"
"- Company Default: the Maturity Margin in Accounting settings.\n"
"- Follow BAS: BAS credit-stop days minus its payment term (LIMT_DAYS - INVDAYS), refreshed by every BAS customer sync.\n"
"- This Customer: the days below, set by hand; BAS never overwrites them.\n"
"Empty behaves as Company Default until the BAS sync fills it."
msgstr ""
